    "equipment-view-ar-320": [
      "a: S Seera",
      "h1: QA-EQ-490472 — QA Integration Excavator",
      "h2: QA-EQ-490472 — QA Integration Excavator",
      "span: Total = quantity × rate (server-calculated). A fuel entry becomes project cost only when Finance posts it (Cash / Bank journal) or the supplier bill it creates is posted.",
      "p: Project and site come from the active assignment at the time of the entry. The expense category's account decides the posting; Cash / Bank needs the account paid from, Supplier Credit needs the supplier and creates a draft supplier bill when Finance posts.",
      "span: Open → Completed (or Cancelled). Completed records stay in the history; cost is posted by Finance after completion.",
      "span: Equipment cost reaches the Project Cost Report and the project budget only through posted accounting (Cash / Bank journal or the posted supplier bill), never from the operational totals below.",
      "td: Each posted journal carries the project / site of the assignment at the time of the entry, so the Project Cost Report and Budget vs Actual (Equipment category, mapped accounts) count it once. Supplier-credit records count through their supplier bill, never twice.",
      "span: Private files (registration, insurance, inspection, permits, invoices, receipts). Served only to authorized users; no public links.",
      "td: Project / site assignment, operator, meter readings from assignments, fuel and maintenance, and the site geofence settings used by mobile attendance. The provider integration contract is documented for the next phase.",
      "span: Latest entries for this asset, limited to the users your role may see"
    ],
